1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:03,942
It's 1 a.m., and Riya is
about to quit her job.

2
00:00:03,942 --> 00:00:07,622
Cursor on Send. The reason?
Today's appraisal…

3
00:00:07,622 --> 00:00:09,265
'Needs improvement.'

4
00:00:09,265 --> 00:00:11,642
Before Send… hear one story.

5
00:00:11,642 --> 00:00:14,906
Just before the war…
Arjuna put down his bow.

6
00:00:14,906 --> 00:00:17,680
He sat down in the chariot…
eyes full of tears.

7
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:20,744
Like Riya… a big
decision, in a tired hour.

8
00:00:20,744 --> 00:00:22,309
Then Krishna said…

9
00:00:22,309 --> 00:00:26,645
Don't give in to this weakness,
Partha; it doesn't suit you…

10
00:00:26,645 --> 00:00:30,784
Cast off this petty weakness of
heart, and stand up.

11
00:00:31,304 --> 00:00:33,995
Drop this weakness of
the heart… and get up.

12
00:00:34,045 --> 00:00:36,035
For us, 'get up' means: don't run…

13
00:00:36,035 --> 00:00:39,490
ask. Arjuna asked (2.7)… and the
answer became the Gita.

14
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:41,832
Riya moved the mail to Draft.

15
00:00:41,832 --> 00:00:45,099
Next morning, she asked her
manager… 'What should I improve?'

16
00:00:45,099 --> 00:00:46,319
Decide in daylight…

17
00:00:46,319 --> 00:00:48,049
not at 1 a.m.

18
00:00:48,049 --> 00:00:49,219
Your call…

19
00:00:49,219 --> 00:00:50,366
Send or Draft?
